commit 9e5cb2ccac385a0615fecbaea22f28b8472d6cdf
Author: Greg Detre <greg@gregdetre.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 1 19:36:58 2026 +0100

    261001p: Summary loses Parts & Sections; the slider alone, a touch wider
    
    Greg (spya-b3ggv4): Parts & Sections overlapped Structure, so Summary is
    now just the Brief / Simple / Fuller slider and its paragraphs.
    
    - SummaryPanel.tsx and its outline go; the bands draw ModeSurface
      themselves. ?deep= and the `gists` view go; ?summary= defaults to
      `simple`, and an old ?summary=gists&deep=2 link lands there. `deep`
      moves to last-view's NEVER_REMEMBERED so an old link still beats a
      restore.
    - The slider is always live, with no level name beside it (7R): an
      icon at each end, each a press on that end's level.
    - Summary's band is "roomy": the standard band capped at 28rem rather
      than 25rem (7Q). bandShapeFor(mode) replaces Reader's two ternaries.
    - Kept: the gists, the Hierarchy stage, buildSummaryTree and
      TreeNode.question, which Structure, Marginalia and others read.
    - The bar's Summary press still arms nothing; generating on open is
      fb7t-7v's item.
    
    Plan and GPT Sol's plan review in docs/plans/261001p-*.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

